<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκ-υσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is drawn</i>, i.e. <i>spun wool</i>,
				Hsch.s.v.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρῖνον</span> (pl.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνῶν ἑ</span>. <i>bodies torn</i> by dogs,
				<i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.200
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκωρία</span>
			, <i>dross of silver</i>, because <i>drawn off with a
			hook</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.236
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				90
			</span></i>.</div>
